// A content mod's defs, merged after the game's (docs/MODDING.md). Three ways to change the game:
//   a new def:            a name the game doesn't have;
//   a def replaced:       the game's name again, every field restated;
//   a def patched:        the game's name with "$patch": "merge" (only the fields given change; objects
//                         merge, arrays are replaced) or "$patch": "remove".
// The game's defs are data/defs/*.json: read the one you're changing. Check with --check-mod.
{
  "seasons": [
    // An example patch, the season a day longer. Delete it, or keep it and make it yours.
    { "name": "Season", "$patch": "merge", "days": 4 }
  ]
}
